A definition body's separator width sets its content column

```
:: term
: definition
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>definition</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: term
: first

  second
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>first</p>
    <p>second</p>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: term
: first

 second
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>first</dd>
</dl>
<p>second</p>
```

```
:: term
:  first

  second
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>first</dd>
</dl>
<p>second</p>
```

```
:: term
: one
:  two
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>one</dd>
  <dd>two</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: term
: +
flush block
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>flush block</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: term
wrapped on
: definition
.
<dl>
  <dt>term
wrapped on</dt>
  <dd>definition</dd>
</dl>
```
